import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="Data processing" description="Data processing terms for shops using Kora Desk.">
  <article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 py-14 prose-kora">
    <h1 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl">Data processing terms</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-muted">Last updated 6 October 2026.</p>
    <p>When you connect a number, you are the controller of your customers’ messages. Kora Desk is a processor for that content and a controller for your account data.</p>
    <h2>Instructions</h2>
    <p>We process messages only to provide the four agents, logs, and exports you enable. We do not train public models on your chats in this design.</p>
    <h2>Security</h2>
    <p>Encryption in transit, encryption at rest, access logs, and regional hosting as described on Trust &amp; security.</p>
    <h2>Subprocessors</h2>
    <p>WhatsApp Business Platform, African-region hosting and backup, transactional email, and error tracking. We confirm the legal entities behind each service on request.</p>
    <h2>Deletion</h2>
    <p>After you leave, we delete operational data within 30 days unless the law says we must keep a slice of the log.</p>
  </article>
</BaseLayout>
